        "A. Go back to watching the movie.":
            $menuhideborder = False
            "(I'll focus on the movie. She'll fall back into the rhythm of it.)"
            "After squeezing Mackenzie's hand underneath the blanket, I turn my attention to the screen again watching as one of the warriors shoots three arrows at once from her bow."
            mcmac "Woah."
            ma "I know, right?"

        "B. Start adding your own comments.":
            $menuhideborder = False
            "(Two can play at the commentary game.)"
            mcmac "Well, I think the commander is gorgeous, and she totally has sexual tension with the warrior in the back there."
            ma "I’d hope so. That’s her wife."
            mcmac "Even better."

        "C. Try to distract her.":
            $menuhideborder = False
            mcmac "If you don't want to keep watching, we could do something else."
            ma "I want to keep watching, I just..."
            "What I've said hits her, and she turns even more red."
            ma "That's a very loaded pair of choices."

    "Despite my teasing, we manage to make it through the rest of the movie."

    "With Mackenzie’s arm around me and the warm pressure of the blankets, I start to drift off as the credits roll."

    "I fall asleep against her, smiling while consciousness drifts away."

